      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'vir ander stukke gebruik': 'ander stukke' is vague for documents and a Grade 6 reader may read 'pieces'.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'en so ook die grootmens wat weet en toelaat': As written the sentence makes the adult who knows and allows it 'misbruik', instead of the knowing and allowing.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Die handves vra verpligte skool wat gratis en gelyk is.': 'gelyk' for a school is vague (equal for all children? equal quality?) and 'verpligte skool' is slightly odd for compulsory schooling; clarifying it would mean guessing what the charter demanded, so it is not changed here."
